      "content": "it's just not just \"grief\" though. it's like the world decided i dont exist. there's no \"healing\" from being persona non grata. every time i try to reach out, the door just slams shut. it feels more like a fact than a feeling... like i'm already gone, just waiting for my body to catch up.",
